# CR 508.1d/509.1c requirements obeyed (ADR-0024): Bloodrock Cyclops
# (3/3, S:Mode$ MustAttack | ValidCreature$ Card.Self) attacks each combat
# if able, and Iron Golem (5/3, S:Mode$ MustBlock | ValidCreature$
# Card.Self) blocks each combat if able. Each declaration names the
# required creature -- leaving either out is an illegal declaration, an
# error rather than one the engine repairs. The Golem's 5 damage kills the
# Cyclops; the Cyclops' 3 kills the Golem.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance
